{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21296","headline":"公安县远安寺水亭见展公题壁漂然泪流因书四韵 · 元稹","name":"公安县远安寺水亭见展公题壁漂然泪流因书四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧涧去年会，与师三两人。\n今来见题壁，师已是前身。\n芰叶迎僧夏，杨花度俗春。\n空将数行泪，洒徧塔中尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}